# Code Owners
#
# This file defines who is automatically requested for review when a pull
# request touches a given path. See:
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REPLACE @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME BELOW with the actual GitHub username (or
# team, e.g. @vrindaya/backend) that should own the repository. The git
# remote for this repo currently points at github.com/GanjiSanketh/vrindaya
# — if that's you, replace the placeholder with @GanjiSanketh.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Default owner for everything not matched more specifically below.
* @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME

# Uncomment and adjust once the team grows past one owner, e.g.:
# /web/    @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME @frontend-teammate
# /api/     @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME @backend-teammate
# /docs/     @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME
# firestore.rules  @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME
# storage.rules     @YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME
